@startuml RestroVibes - Admin Operations
!theme plain
title RestroVibes - Admin Panel Operations

actor Admin as A
participant "Frontend\n(Admin Panel)" as FE
participant "Express API" as API
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "ScoringEngine" as Score

== ADMIN: CREATE USER (Any Role) ==

A -> FE : Create user via admin panel
FE -> API : POST /api/auth/register\n{ name, email, password,\nrole: "admin" }\n(Authorization: Bearer <adminToken>)
API -> API : Verify caller has admin role\n(allowed: ["client","restaurateurs","admin"])
API -> DB : Create user with any role
API --> FE : 201 { user info }\n(no auto-login as new user)

== ADMIN: UPDATE ANY USER ==

A -> FE : Edit user profile
FE -> API : PUT /api/users/:id\n{ first_name, phone, ... }
API -> API : Verify: caller is admin\n(admin bypass: no same-user check)
API -> DB : Validate phone, hash password if changed
API -> DB : UPDATE user record
API --> FE : 200 Updated

== ADMIN: DELETE USER ==

A -> FE : Delete user
FE -> API : DELETE /api/users/delete/:id
API -> DB : Verify caller role = "admin"
API -> DB : Verify target is not also admin
API -> DB : UPDATE related appointments\nstatus -> "cancelled"
API -> DB : DELETE FROM users WHERE id = :id
API --> FE : 200 User deleted

== ADMIN: CANCEL ANY APPOINTMENT ==

A -> FE : Cancel appointment
FE -> API : PUT /api/appointments/:id/cancel
API -> API : Admin bypass:\nno ownership check needed
API -> DB : UPDATE status -> "cancelled"
API --> FE : 200 Cancelled

== ADMIN: BACKFILL ALL PENALTIES ==

A -> FE : Recalculate all client scores
FE -> API : POST /api/appointments/admin/backfill-penalties
API -> DB : SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE role = 'client'
DB --> API : All client records

loop For each client
    API -> Score : recalculateUserPenalty(clientId)
    Score -> DB : SELECT status, COUNT(*)\nFROM booking_history\nWHERE client_id = clientId\nGROUP BY status
    DB --> Score : Counts by status
    Score -> Score : Compute penaltyScore,\nreliability_status,\nis_flagged
    Score -> DB : UPDATE user cached fields
end

API --> FE : 200 All penalties recalculated

== ADMIN: MANUAL LOTTERY RESOLVE ==

A -> FE : Resolve contested slot manually
FE -> API : POST /api/lottery/resolve\n{ restaurantId: 15,\nbookingDate: "2026-09-03",\ntimeSlot: "12:00" }
API -> API : Inline admin-only middleware:\nreq.user.role === "admin"
API -> DB : Fetch lottery entries for slot
API -> API : Run weighted lottery algorithm
API -> DB : Winner -> status = "accepted"
API -> DB : Losers -> status = "cancelled"
API --> FE : 200 { winner, losers }

== ADMIN: MANAGE ANY RESTAURANT TABLES ==

A -> FE : Create table for any restaurant
FE -> API : POST /api/tables\n{ restaurateurId: 15,\ntable_number: "VIP-1", capacity: 8 }
API -> API : Admin bypass:\nno restaurateurId ownership check
API -> DB : INSERT INTO tables
API --> FE : 201 Table created

== ADMIN: VIEW ALL DATA ==

A -> FE : View all bookings
FE -> API : GET /api/appointments/all
API -> DB : SELECT * FROM appointments\nORDER BY date DESC
API --> FE : All appointments

A -> FE : View all users
FE -> API : GET /api/users/all
API -> DB : SELECT * FROM users
API --> FE : All users

A -> FE : View all tables
FE -> API : GET /api/tables/all
API -> DB : SELECT t.*, u.first_name, u.last_name\nFROM tables t\nJOIN users u ON t.restaurateur_id = u.id
API --> FE : All tables with owner info

@enduml
